    "p1": { "id": "p1", "r": 12, "type": "text", "parent": "fa", "role": "p", "indent": 0, "md": "A **wave** carries *energy*, not matter. Its period $T$ and frequency $f$ satisfy $f = 1/T$. See [the notes](https://example.com/waves), ==remember== the [key idea]{color=red}, and use `v = f λ` with ~~speed~~ velocity." },
    "p2": { "id": "p2", "r": 13, "type": "text", "parent": "fa", "role": "p", "indent": 0, "md": "The lab kit costs $5, or $10 with the stand." },
